        <name>NPD_MEMIC_NODETYPE_MASK</name>
        <initializer>((u32)0xFU &lt;&lt; NPD_MEMIC_NODETYPE_SHIFT)</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Mask of the MEMIC node-type nibble inside an NpdMemIcAddresses[] entry. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Used to encode the type into the upper 4 bits and to extract it via (addr &amp; MASK) &gt;&gt; SHIFT. </para>        </detaileddescription>
